    {
      "id": "7de99b6d-2460-4455-ae0d-2361d5d5c3da",
      "title": "Escute e leia a primeira linha da resposta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "50801bb4-1293-4d4f-bdf5-950bfa93cd88",
          "textContent": "<p>Primeira linha da resposta:</p><p><strong>En mi barrio hay una cafetería y un mercado.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>No meu bairro tem uma cafeteria e um mercado.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c033af3e62d44947b3cb35459815597e_b02-en-mi-barrio-hay-una-cafeteria-y-un-mercado.mp3?Expires=1794099483&Signature=kYb39dKcDNGz5SFOC60Bz~ElkjHlhR2qzeygvsu~eU-7ekH-z2ZFVLIyBKU9UDmiyRLAuqRRw2UOWz~SWmBLIv9AQ2Uhjag9CXftp~F1hvYUCoICjE3HPsFb7-zkzHLfJ029fKeNidZGTNkk9DBCXHUWgcCec52WXmO9jiKzjlDhcdbnUgqoG5lIbw9MYAW09a8ccBncsvy1UQ4oyz3-B-yx4vpxk-TyO5N~sI6381Lisa9Dx-huZGysI6Zq1OFbtM4kZOMwSrxKuX22i4v5Ov3eOLVp4IaSjHE-X3YhXZSy16B5McBJcanJXyEccRPnkrdYpC22qrNTox53DmLfmg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
